I have created this mod with a simple purpose: to bring Dark Elves as a sole ingame race a bit closer to Warhammer 3 standarts.


What does this mod contains?
– It contains various new character skills for the Dark Elf lords and heroes, as well as (some) reworked or rebalanced versions of an already exsting ones.

Does this mod affect in any way races other than Dark Elves?
– No, it does not.

What is the general powerscale of this mod?
– I've tried my best to bring up most of the stuff in this mod in line with an overall balance of the base WH3 game, this is not a powerfantasy mod and it mainly serves for a player to have more stuff to play with, rather than nessesearly boost overall power of the Dark Elves over the top. Yet, it also doesn't nerf the race in any significant way, once again, it's an extra content, more or less.

Are there any known incompatabilities with other mods?
– There are. Any mods that affect the same skills, as well as mods that remake heroes or lords of the Dark Elves in any fashion or add new types/versions of heroes and lords for the Dark Elves. If you want this mod to be specifically compatable with something, you're free to make a submod or ask me to do it.

Will this mod be updated and supported?
– I will update and support this mod for as long as I can.


Planned updates and addtions:

1) Names of Power rework (some of them do nothing, while others are a bit too op);
2) Morathi's unique trait rework (too boring, too weak baseline);
3) Some skills and abilities that for one or the other reason haven't made it into the current version of the mod;
4) Various fixes and balance changes, when and where I'll consider such nesseseary;
5) Initial integration with the other my Dark Elves mods that are currently in development.

_________________________________________________________________

Updated for 9.0 along with some additions

List of changes: 

- Reduced max damage threshold for the Living Conduit ability, allowing it to reach it's max effect faster;
- Increased Emulous Impatience cooldown reduction from 10% to 15%;
- The Merciless Host now grands it's bonuses to all types of infantry and cavalry, instead of the specific Dark Elf units;
- Master of the Cold Ones got it's description fixed to correctly display all bonuses for the Feral Cold Ones;
- Bound by Contract now reduces Assasin's upkeep while he's embedded in an army;
- Mistress of the Wild has it's upkeep bonuses extended to all monster types;
- Morathi's unique trait Dark Manipulator has been reworked, now allowing her army to seduce units. Since the effect is army-based, she'd able to do so after you confederate her as other Dark Elf faction. It now also gives experience to all characters in the same province with Morathi. Ritual bonuses has been transferred to Morathi's set bonus;
- Enchanting Beauty skill now also gives seduction based bonuses to compliment Morathi's new trait;
- Minor type and grammar fixes.
